<H2>Events</H2>



<LI>From: Phil Walker(<A HREF="mailto:LUSS@lancaster.ac.uk">LUSS@lancaster.ac.uk</A>)<BR>
11th October 1997 10.00am at Underpass / Infirmary : This first trip of the term will be this Saturday leaving the underpass at 10.00am.

We will be going to the Long Churn Caves at Selside to 
give an introduction to caving for the new members.

Anyone is welcome including past LUSS members who might 
want to give a hand.

Interested people should sign up on Tuesday 7th October
in Lonsdale Bar at 8.00pm or else leave their name and contact number 
on the notice board in Bowland Foyer.

N.B.  Because of the cost of organising the first trip anyone who does'nt inform 
us that they will not be going by Thursday night will have to 
pay the trip fee.

